        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    investments = [500, 600, 1000]\n    returns = [0.12, 0.05, 0.01]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_investment = sum(investments)\n    total_return = sum(investment * rate for investment, rate in zip(investments, returns))\n    holding_period_return = (total_return / total_investment) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(holding_period_return, 3)\n```",
